@startuml screening-plan-model-en
hide circle
hide empty members
left to right direction
title How a screening plan links to the record

class "ServiceRequest (plan)" as ScreeningPlan [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-servicerequest.html{Open the UZ Core ServiceRequest profile}]]
class PlanDefinition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-plan-definition.html{Open the UZ Core PlanDefinition profile}]]
class ActivityDefinition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-activitydefinition.html{Open the UZ Core ActivityDefinition profile}]]
class "ScreeningPatient" as PlanPatient [[StructureDefinition-screening-patient.html{Open the ScreeningPatient profile}]] #E8F0FE
class "QuestionnaireResponse,\nScreeningObservation,\nScreeningDiagnosticReport,\nScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure,\nScreeningServiceRequest" as Evidence #E8F0FE
class "ScreeningSpecimen" as PlanSpecimen [[StructureDefinition-screening-specimen.html{Open the ScreeningSpecimen profile}]] #E8F0FE
class "Condition" as PlanCondition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-condition.html{Open the UZ Core Condition profile}]]

Evidence "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « basedOn »
PlanSpecimen "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « request »
PlanCondition "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « extension[event-basedOn] »
ScreeningPlan "0..*" --> "1" PlanPatient : « subject »
ScreeningPlan "0..*" --> "0..1" PlanDefinition : « instantiatesCanonical »
PlanDefinition "0..*" --> "0..*" ActivityDefinition : « action.definitionCanonical »

caption Clinical resources keep their link to the immediate order alongside the plan.
@enduml
